+ * L+R+A+Start ends the match as LRAS; a local Start tap only toggles the pause display. In Party
+ * (Slippi 3.7.0) an L+R+A+Start only takes the local player out (mu_online_leave: the host then
+ * disconnects and the game ends for this player like any disconnect) while the others keep
+ * playing, and it works without stocks too, as does the pause display. */
